// Conformance fixture for ta.percentile_linear_interpolation
// (S-bead OpenBBTechnical-0e9.5.42, Wave 5B-4).
//
// Author-derivative posture per PRD §7.3: reference output computed by
// hand-executing the linear-interpolation percentile against a
// hard-coded synthetic close series (see
// ta_percentile_linear_interpolation.csv `close` column).
//
// Fixture length = 5, percentage = 50 (median-equivalent for length 5 —
// the 3rd sorted element, no interpolation needed at this exact rank).
// Warmup: first ``length - 1`` = 4 bars are NA. PyneCore's arg name is
// ``percentage`` (0..100 scale), not ``percentile``.
//@version=6
indicator("smoke_ta_percentile_linear_interpolation", overlay=true)
plot(ta.percentile_linear_interpolation(close, 5, 50), title="pct50")
